<item><title>Madagascar court moves Ambohimalaza poisoning trial toward former health minister</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/madagascar-court-moves-ambohimalaza-poisoning-trial-toward-7674ad/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/madagascar-court-moves-ambohimalaza-poisoning-trial-toward-7674ad/</guid><category>Madagascar</category><description>Lawyers for the civil parties want the former health minister, doctors and gendarmes called as witnesses over the response to the poisoning that killed at least 35 people.</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 06:37:35 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/madagascar-court-moves-ambohimalaza-poisoning-trial-toward-7674ad/share.jpg" length="41027" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/madagascar-court-moves-ambohimalaza-poisoning-trial-toward-7674ad/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
